{"t":"Lion's Rock Quest","s":"lion-s-rock-quest-c82c6","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lion's Rock Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Lion's Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30-45 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(70 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A rock formation has been discovered north-west of Darashia.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock\">Lion's Rock</a> near <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler\">Sandcrawler</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomad</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarab</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Shambler\">Crypt Shambler</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\">Cobra</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion\">Noble Lion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Lion\">Roaring Lion</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Den%20Explorer\">Lion's Den Explorer</a>. Random item out of the following: <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Lion%27s%20Heart\">The Lion's Heart</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Brown%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Brown)</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Bangle\">Emerald Bangle</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Tongue\">Cobra Tongue</a> (mission only)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (daily task)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (daily task)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (daily task)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (daily task)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Mission\">Mission</span></h2>\n<p>Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock\">Lion's Rock</a> west by north-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, near the Darashian portal to Gnomebase, here:\n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 128px; height: 128px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -2708px;left:-2734px;clip:rect(2708px 2862px 2836px 2734px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:64px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:64px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33143,32362,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33143, 32362, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<figure class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 32px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Lion's Mane Flower (Immobile)\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Mane_Flower_Immobile_92260a.gif\" width=\"32\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Start by exploring the above ground rock; climb the staircases inside and outside the mountain. On the upper floors you can find 1) <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Mane%20Flower\">Lion's Mane Flower</a>: use to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Mane%20Flower\">Lion's Mane Flower</a>, and 2) a <a href=\"#/wiki/Well%20with%20a%20Lion-Like%20Face\">fountain</a>; use to obtain an <a href=\"#/wiki/Ewer%20with%20Holy%20Water\">Ewer with Holy Water</a>; note: you cannot take holy water from the well more than once in a short time (1 day?).\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You took some holy water from the sacred well.</span></dd></dl>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dead Explorer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dead_Human3_6ed5c5.gif\" width=\"32\"/><figcaption>Dead Explorer</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Once you have both items, make your way to the underground cave. Not far from the start you will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Explorer\">Dead Explorer</a>, use the corpse to obtain an <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock%20Three%20Tests%20%28Book%29\">Old Parchment (Brown)</a>. here:\n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 128px; height: 128px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -2668px;left:-2738px;clip:rect(2668px 2866px 2796px 2738px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:64px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:64px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33145,32342,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33145, 32342, 8)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Three_Trials\"><u>Three Trials</u></span></h3>\n<div style=\"float: right; padding: 0 0 0.5em 0.5em;\"><div class=\"game-book-display\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 441px; border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #767676 #2b2b2b #2b2b2b #767676; background-color: #393a3a; overflow: hidden; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2em;\">\n<div class=\"header\" style=\"height: 14px; text-align: center; color: #8a8a8a; font-weight: bold; overflow: hidden;\">Show Text</div>\n<div class=\"content-container\" style=\"background-color: #4a4a49; height: 425px; color: #bfbfbf; font-weight: bold; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #2b2b2b #787878 #787878 #2b2b2b;\">\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"width: 100%; margin: 6px 0; padding: 0 14px; text-align: left;\">\n<div class=\"header\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; height: 32px; width: 100%; position: relative;\">\n<div class=\"header-content\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Old Parchment (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Parchment_Brown_49b8be.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span class=\"book-title\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0;\">You read the following.\n</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"text-container\" style=\"background-color: #363636; width: 248px; height: 314px; margin: 18px 0; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #2b2b2b #777676 #777676 #2b2b2b; overflow-y: scroll; overflow-x: hidden;\">\"Still it is hard to believe that I finally found the mystical rock formations near Darashia, known as Lion's Rock. According to ancient records there is a temple for an unknown, probably long forgotten deity, built in the tunnels deep below the rock centuries ago. This holy site was once guarded by mystical lions and they may still be down there. But yet I haven't succeeded in entering the inner sanctum. The entrance to the lower temple areas is protected by an old and powerful enchantment. I studied the inscriptions on the temple walls and thus learned that the key to the inner sanctum is the passing of three tests. The first test is the Lion's Strength. In order to honour the site's mystical cats of prey one has to hunt and slay a cobra. The cobra's tongue must be laid down at a stone statue as a sacrifice. The second test is the Lion's Beauty. One has to burn the petals of a lion's mane flower on a coal basin. In the sand at the rock's foot I saw some dried lion's mane petals. Maybe these flowers grow somewhere upwards. The third test is called the Lion's Tears. It seems one has to purify an ornamented stone pedestal with ...\" At this point the records end because the parchment is destroyed. It seems that is was torn by a big paw …</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer\">\n<hr style=\"margin: 2px auto; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #272727 transparent #767676 transparent; width: 260px;\"/>\n<div class=\"ok-box\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #767676 #2b2b2b #2b2b2b #767676; width: 41px; height: 18px; text-align: center; float: right; margin: 6px 12px 0 0;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock%20Three%20Tests%20%28Book%29\">Go</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\nThis floor has a series of tunnels which lead to small rooms filled with semi-weak undead monsters. You must complete 3 trials to progress, marked on the map below. It doesn't really matter in which order.<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-4\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 409px; height: 409px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -5203px;left:-5423px;clip:rect(5203px 5832px 5612px 5423px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"8192\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\" width=\"10240\"/></span></span>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5556px; top:5248px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-220px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span><div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px;margin:0px;border:none;position:absolute;display:block;line-height:normal;font-size:20px;width:22px;height:22px;left:220px;top:22px;\">1</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5628px; top:5200px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-220px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span><div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px;margin:0px;border:none;position:absolute;display:block;line-height:normal;font-size:20px;width:22px;height:22px;left:220px;top:22px;\">2</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5556px; top:5560px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-220px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span><div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px;margin:0px;border:none;position:absolute;display:block;line-height:normal;font-size:20px;width:22px;height:22px;left:220px;top:22px;\">3</div></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33151,32328,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33151, 32328, 8)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<h4><span id=\"w-The_Lion.27s_Strength\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Lion's_Strength\">The Lion's Strength</span></h4>\n<p>(Marked 1 in mini map, North West)\n</p><p>You will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Slightly%20Feline%20Statue\">Slightly Feline Statue</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33136,32290,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33136, 32290, 8)</a>. Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Tongue\">Cobra Tongue</a> on this statue. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Pagoda\">Small Pagoda</a> will light up signifying that you have passed the trial. You will also receive a server message:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You have sacrificed a cobra tongue at an ancient statue. The light in the small pyramid nearby begins to shine.</span></dd></dl>\n<h4><span id=\"w-The_Lion.27s_Tears\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Lion's_Tears\">The Lion's Tears</span></h4>\n<p>(Marked 2 in mini map, North East, just east of the first trial)\n</p><p>You will find an <a href=\"#/wiki/Ornamented%20Stone%20Pedestal\">Ornamented Stone Pedestal</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33154,32280,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33154, 32280, 8)</a>. Pour the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ewer%20with%20Holy%20Water\">Ewer with Holy Water</a> onto the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ornamented%20Stone%20Pedestal\">Ornamented Stone Pedestal</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Pagoda\">Small Pagoda</a> will light up.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You have purified a sacred pedestal with holy water. You have now passed the last test to  enter the inner sanctum.</span></dd></dl>\n<h4><span id=\"w-The_Lion.27s_Beauty\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Lion's_Beauty\">The Lion's Beauty</span></h4>\n<p>(Marked 3 in mini map, South West)\n</p><p>You will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal%20Basin\">Coal Basin</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33136,32369,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33136, 32369, 8)</a>. Burn the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Mane%20Flower\">Lion's Mane Flower</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal%20Basin\">Coal Basin</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Pagoda\">Small Pagoda</a> will light up.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You burnt a lion's mane flower. The light in the small pyramid nearby begins to shine.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>Completing the 3 trials will enable you to enter the <b>Inner Sanctum</b>, through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\">Mystic Flame</a> on the west side of this floor. You can enter as many times as you like without redoing the trials.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You have passed the Lion's Tests and are now worthy to enter the inner sanctum!</span></dd></dl>\n<p>Go through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\">Mystic Flame</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33128,32308,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33128, 32308, 8)</a>) to continue the quest.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Scroll_Translation\"><u>Scroll Translation</u></span></h3>\n<p>On the second floor you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Lion\">Roaring Lions</a>. The floor is split into 3 parts, which are each connected by a small tunnel on the third floor. You start in the middle part. This part of the quest involves getting a Translation Scroll (marked 1 on the map), then walking by 4 areas to translate the inscriptions (marked with blue flags.)\n</p><p><b>Getting the translation scroll (marked 1 in the map):</b> On the second floor, go west and north and down a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33114,32296,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33114, 32296, 9)</a>. Then walk north and go up <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33122,32281,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33122, 32281, 10)</a>. Now walk north and run past a <a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Amphora\">Large Amphora</a> in the middle of the room, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33119,32247,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33119, 32247, 9)</a>. It will crumble, and along with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Translation%20Scroll\">Translation Scroll</a> you will receive the following message:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">As you pass incautiously, the ancient amphora crumbles to shards and dust. Amidst the debris you discover an old scroll.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>Now that you have the <a href=\"#/wiki/Translation%20Scroll\">Translation Scroll</a>, make your way to the 4 areas marked blue, the scroll will automatically activate giving you a white server message when you're in the right spot.\n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-4\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 512px; height: 512px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -5016px;left:-5220px;clip:rect(5016px 5732px 5528px 5220px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"8192\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_9_ca2896.png\" width=\"10240\"/></span></span>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5488px; top:5080px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-220px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span><div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px;margin:0px;border:none;position:absolute;display:block;line-height:normal;font-size:20px;width:22px;height:22px;left:220px;top:22px;\">1</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5520px; top:5452px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5532px; top:5288px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5392px; top:5060px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:5448px; top:5404px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33113,32294,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33113, 32294, 9)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena%20Statue\">Hyaena Statue</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33126,32338,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33126, 32338, 9)</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>From the start, go to the south-east. Go down the stairs <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33132,32322,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33132, 32322, 9)</a> and go up the stairs at the south end of the tunnel <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33139,32336,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33139, 32336, 10)</a>. You'll be in the south-east area now.</li>\n<li>Go to the westernmost part of this area (south and then west of the stairs). You will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena%20Statue\">Hyaena Statue</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33127,32340,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33127, 32340, 9)</a> and receive the following server message:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">With the aid of the old scroll you translate the inscriptions on the golden statue: And the mighty lion defeated the greedy hyaena. As a sign of victory he took its blood, red as voracity and lust, and created a precious treasure.</span></dd></dl>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Carved%20Stone%20Tile%20%28Lizard%29\">Carved Stone Tile (Lizard)</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33131,32301,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33131, 32301, 9)</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>From the hyaena statue, go back north-east and go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33139,32336,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33139, 32336, 9)</a>. Go up the stairs at the end of the tunnel <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33133,32321,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33133, 32321, 10)</a> to arrive back at the middle area.</li>\n<li>The egg inscription is to the north-east of this area, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33131,32301,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33131, 32301, 9)</a>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">With the aid of the old scroll you translate the inscriptions on the floor: And the mighty lion defeated the lazy lizard. As a sign of victory he took its egg, blue as sloth and conceit, and out of a foul creature he created a precious treasure.</span></dd></dl>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake%20Ornament\">Snake Ornament</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33095,32244,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33095, 32244, 9)</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>From the egg inscription, go to the far north-west part of the floor. Go down the stairs <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33114,32296,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33114, 32296, 9)</a> and follow the tunnel north. Go up the stairs <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33121,32280,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33121, 32280, 10)</a> to arrive at the north-west area.</li>\n<li>The snake inscription is at the north side of this area, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33095,32244,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33095, 32244, 9)</a>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">With the aid of the old scroll you translate the inscriptions on the floor: And the mighty lion defeated the jealous snake. As a sign of victory he took its eye, yellow as envy and malevolence, and out of a foul creature he created a precious treasure</span></dd></dl>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Altar\">Scorpion Altar</a>, Middle area, which is on the south-west of the area, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33108,32329,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33108, 32329, 9)</a>.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">With the aid of the old scroll you translate the inscriptions on the golden altar: And the mighty lion defeated the treacherous scorpion. As a sign of victory he took its poison, violet as deceit and betrayal, and created a precious treasure.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>These inscriptions give you the solution for the next riddle, namely the colors (<b>red</b>, <b>blue</b>, <b>yellow</b>, <b>violet</b>).\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"9796909958f1c0e5b6d35f7d5193488a\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Lion-s_Quest_Obtained_Scroll-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:120px; width:185px; top:20px;\"><img alt=\"You can receive a Translation Scroll a few seconds after breaking a Dusty Amphora.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"You can receive a  a few seconds after breaking a .\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Quest_Obtained_Scroll_384b22.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Lion's Quest Obtained Scroll.png (282 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">You can receive a <a href=\"#/wiki/Translation%20Scroll\">Translation Scroll</a> a few seconds after breaking a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dusty%20Amphora\">Dusty Amphora</a>.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Lion-s_Quest_Golden_Hyaena_Inscription-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:143px; width:185px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"Walk near the Hyaena Statue to translate the 1st inscription.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Walk near the  to translate the 1st inscription.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Quest_Golden_Hyaena_Inscription_405b0e.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Lion's Quest Golden Hyaena Inscription.png (469 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Walk near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena%20Statue\">Hyaena Statue</a> to translate the 1st inscription.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Lion-s_Quest_Lizard_Inscription-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:160px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Walk near the lizard floor inscription to translate the 2nd inscription.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Walk near the lizard floor inscription to translate the 2nd inscription.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Quest_Lizard_Inscription_6757c6.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Lion's Quest Lizard Inscription.png (312 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Walk near the lizard floor inscription to translate the 2nd inscription.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Lion-s_Quest_Snake_Inscription-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:185px; top:30px;\"><img alt=\"Walk near the snake floor inscription to translate the 3rd inscription.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Walk near the snake floor inscription to translate the 3rd inscription.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Quest_Snake_Inscription_9f234d.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Lion's Quest Snake Inscription.png (217 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Walk near the snake floor inscription to translate the 3rd inscription.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Lion-s_Quest_Golden_Altar-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:150px; width:185px; top:5px;\"><img alt=\"Walk near the golden altar to translate the 4th inscription.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Walk near the golden altar to translate the 4th inscription.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Quest_Golden_Altar_86a655.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Lion's Quest Golden Altar.png (511 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Walk near the golden altar to translate the 4th inscription.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Task\">Task</span></h2>\n<p>After completing the mission to grant access to the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGlvbiUyN3NfUm9ja19Jbm5lcl9TYW5jdHVtP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Lion's Rock Inner Sanctum (page does not exist)\">Lion's Rock Inner Sanctum</span> and translate the scroll you can do this task to obtain a random reward. In the north-west area of the Inner Sanctum, find the southern rectangular room to the south-west, here: \n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 76px; height: 76px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1285px;left:-1291px;clip:rect(1285px 1367px 1361px 1291px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_9_ca2896.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:76px;width:38px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:38px;width:76px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33074,32300,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33074, 32300, 9)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p>In this room you will find 4 \"sun\" floor inscriptions as well as a rock in the center. The sun inscriptions represent gem slots.\n</p><p>Here you must use gems corresponding to the slot's representation. You can see the slot's representation by looking at the tile.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 300px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Each gem must be used in a specific socket to light it up.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"221\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_s_Rock_Quest_Fountain_b8769c.png\" width=\"300\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Each gem must be used in a specific socket to light it up.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The north-west slot represents a hyaena's maw. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (hyaena blood) on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Tile%20with%20a%20Socket%20%28Hyaena%27s%20Maw%29\">Stone Tile with a Socket</a>. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Flame\">Red Flame</a> will momentarily light up the slot.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You place the ruby on the small socket. A red flame begins to burn.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>The south-west slot represents a nest. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (lizard egg) on the Stone Tile with a Socket. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Flame\">Blue Flame</a> will momentarily light up the slot.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You place the sapphire on the small socket. A blue flame begins to burn.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>The north-east slot represents a snake's mouth. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (snake eye) on the Stone Tile with a Socket. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Flame\">Yellow Flame</a> will momentarily light up the slot.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You place the topaz on the small socket. A yellow flame begins to burn.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>The south-east slot represents a scorpion's pincer. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (scorpion poison) on the Stone Tile with a Socket. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Flame\">Violet Flame</a> will momentarily light up the slot.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You place the amethyst on the small socket. A violet flame begins to burn. Something happens at the center of the room ...</span></dd></dl>\n<p>Once you have sacrificed all 4 of the gems, a bubbling <a href=\"#/wiki/Ornamented%20Fountain\">Ornamented Fountain</a> will appear in the middle of the room where the rocks were. Use the fountain to get your reward, which will be random out of the items listed below.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Something sparkles in the fountain's water. You draw out a beautiful and certainly precious amulet.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>Possible rewards from the fountain are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Lion%27s%20Heart\">The Lion's Heart</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Brown%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Brown)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Bangle\">Emerald Bangle</a></li></ul>\n<p>You can repeat this every 24 hours (not 20 hours, like most other tasks) to obtain another random reward.\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Lion's Rock Quest/Statistics</p></div>\n<p>If you have obtained the <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion%20%28Mount%29\">Noble Lion mount</a>, you cannot obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Lion%27s%20Heart\">The Lion's Heart</a>, even if you never obtained <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Lion%27s%20Heart\">The Lion's Heart</a> from the fountain. Be aware that you will be able to use your small gems on the sockets (to reveal the fountain) even if you cannot obtain a reward. In that case, using the fountain results in the following message: \n</p><p><i>At the moment there is neither a treasure nor anything else in the fountain. Perhaps you might return later.</i>\n</p><p><b>Also note that other players can use the fountain that you revealed, so it's not wise to do it if somebody is around that you do not trust.</b>\n</p><p>You can leave now if you choose to. If you obtained <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Lion%27s%20Heart\">The Lion's Heart</a> you can tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion\">Noble Lion</a>. To reach the <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion\">Noble Lions</a> you must go to the lion temple. Go north of the gem room and follow the tunnel west until you reach an intersection. Turn east at the intersection and go down the stairs. On the first time going down here you will receive the server message:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You enter a temple area which is gorgeously decorated and mysteriously unaffected by the course of time.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>In the lion temple you will only find <a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Lion\">Roaring Lions</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion\">Noble Lions</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["grimvale-quest"]}